          {
            "text": "At Oxygen Tours Koh Tao, we are deeply conscious of the marine resources and the delicate ecosystem of our service areas. This sustainability project was established to inspire our team, pass that passion on to our travelers, and ensure our organization lives in harmony with the local community for a sustainable future.",
